       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/9d562d2fdef1ff58e3053e0ce6aca296?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FNR-5.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/9d562d2fdef1ff58e3053e0ce6aca296?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FNR-5.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/9d562d2fdef1ff58e3053e0ce6aca296?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FNR-5.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Nick Ruest",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3Afe14f014-ccfb-4882-b081-85802f8c5346",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Here is a first pass for review. I guess we should figure where to put this for version control. fcrepo-import-export seems like the obvious option. Other consideration, is do we actually want to publish it at <a href=\"http://fedora.info/fcrepoBagProfile.json\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fedora.info/fcrepoBagProfile.json</a>, and what the filename should be.</p>\n\n<p>Stakeholders: <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5fc7c7e5dd0c59007543ad76\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"5fc7c7e5dd0c59007543ad76\" data-account-id=\"5fc7c7e5dd0c59007543ad76\" accountid=\"5fc7c7e5dd0c59007543ad76\" rel=\"noreferrer\">kestlund</a> <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5cdf0dfb3b428d0dcd7c7c4d\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"5cdf0dfb3b428d0dcd7c7c4d\" data-account-id=\"5cdf0dfb3b428d0dcd7c7c4d\" accountid=\"5cdf0dfb3b428d0dcd7c7c4d\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Former user</a> <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65\" data-account-id=\"5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65\" accountid=\"5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Esmé Cowles</a> <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=6089a519bb0b0500707c7173\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"6089a519bb0b0500707c7173\" data-account-id=\"6089a519bb0b0500707c7173\" accountid=\"6089a519bb0b0500707c7173\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Adam Wead</a> <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=6089a5019889d5006a6c0d5f\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"6089a5019889d5006a6c0d5f\" data-account-id=\"6089a5019889d5006a6c0d5f\" accountid=\"6089a5019889d5006a6c0d5f\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Mark Jordan</a>, let me know what you think. ...and <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=60785ded115da6006f540529\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"60785ded115da6006f540529\" data-account-id=\"60785ded115da6006f540529\" accountid=\"60785ded115da6006f540529\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Andrew Woods</a> too <img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/smile.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"/></p>\n\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\n{\r\n   <span class=\"code-quote\">\"BagIt-Profile-Info\"</span>:{\r\n      <span class=\"code-quote\">\"BagIt-Profile-Identifier\"</span>:<span class=\"code-quote\">\"http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//fedora.info/fcrepoBagProfile.json\"</span>,\r\n</span>      <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Source-Organization\"</span>:<span class=\"code-quote\">\"Duraspace\"</span>,\r\n      <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Contact-Name\"</span>:<span class=\"code-quote\">\"Nick Ruest\"</span>,\r\n      <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Contact-Email\"</span>:<span class=\"code-quote\">\"ruestn@yorku.ca\"</span>,\r\n      <span class=\"code-quote\">\"External-Description\"</span>:<span class=\"code-quote\">\"Default Bag Profile <span class=\"code-keyword\">for</span> Fedora.\"</span>,\r\n      <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Version\"</span>:<span class=\"code-quote\">\"1.2\"</span>\r\n   },\r\n   <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Bag-Info\"</span>:{\r\n      <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Source-Organization\"</span>:{\r\n         <span class=\"code-quote\">\"required\"</span>:<span class=\"code-keyword\">true</span>\r\n      },\r\n      <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Organization-Address\"</span>:{\r\n         <span class=\"code-quote\">\"required\"</span>:<span class=\"code-keyword\">false</span>\r\n      },\r\n      <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Contact-Name\"</span>:{\r\n         <span class=\"code-quote\">\"required\"</span>:<span class=\"code-keyword\">false</span>\r\n      },\r\n      <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Contact-Phone\"</span>:{\r\n         <span class=\"code-quote\">\"required\"</span>:<span class=\"code-keyword\">false</span>\r\n      },\r\n      <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Contact-Email\"</span>:{\r\n         <span class=\"code-quote\">\"required\"</span>:<span class=\"code-keyword\">false</span>\r\n      },\r\n      <span class=\"code-quote\">\"External-Description\"</span>:{\r\n         <span class=\"code-quote\">\"required\"</span>:<span class=\"code-keyword\">false</span>\r\n      },\r\n      <span class=\"code-quote\">\"External-Identifier\"</span>:{\r\n         <span class=\"code-quote\">\"required\"</span>:<span class=\"code-keyword\">false</span>\r\n      },\r\n      <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Bag-Size\"</span>:{\r\n         <span class=\"code-quote\">\"required\"</span>:<span class=\"code-keyword\">true</span>\r\n      },\r\n      <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Bag-Group-Identifier\"</span>:{\r\n         <span class=\"code-quote\">\"required\"</span>:<span class=\"code-keyword\">false</span>\r\n      },\r\n      <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Bag-Count\"</span>:{\r\n         <span class=\"code-quote\">\"required\"</span>:<span class=\"code-keyword\">false</span>\r\n      },\r\n      <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Internal-Sender-Identifier\"</span>:{\r\n         <span class=\"code-quote\">\"required\"</span>:<span class=\"code-keyword\">false</span>\r\n      },\r\n      <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Internal-Sender-Description\"</span>:{\r\n         <span class=\"code-quote\">\"required\"</span>:<span class=\"code-keyword\">false</span>\r\n      },\r\n      <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Bagging-Date\"</span>:{\r\n         <span class=\"code-quote\">\"required\"</span>:<span class=\"code-keyword\">true</span>\r\n      },\r\n      <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Payload-Oxum\"</span>:{\r\n         <span class=\"code-quote\">\"required\"</span>:<span class=\"code-keyword\">true</span>\r\n      }\r\n   },\r\n   <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Manifests-Required\"</span>:[\r\n      <span class=\"code-quote\">\"sha1\"</span>\r\n   ],\r\n   <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Allow-Fetch.txt\"</span>:<span class=\"code-keyword\">false</span>,\r\n   <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Serialization\"</span>:<span class=\"code-quote\">\"optional\"</span>,\r\n   <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Tag-Manifests-Required\"</span>:[\r\n     <span class=\"code-quote\">\"sha1\"</span>\r\n   ],\r\n   <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Accept-BagIt-Version\"</span>:[\r\n      <span class=\"code-quote\">\"0.97\"</span>\r\n   ]\r\n}\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>",
